# Only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md, src/, the user manual and the
# runbooks (docs/manual/, docs/runbooks/ and zensical.toml, for the help pages inside the app) go
# into the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!src/
!zensical.toml
!docs/manual/
!docs/runbooks/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
